note.p:
Source: Department of State, Central Files, 762.00/7-2961. Secret; Priority;
                    Limited Distribution. The source text bears the note “DR saw Sat,” i.e., July
                    29.

At 4:51 p.m. on July 29 the Department of State cabled the Embassy in Moscow that
                    the President wanted McCloy to return directly to Washington. (Telegram 303;
                    Department of State, Central Files, 600.0012/7-2961)
